      "text":"@solana @swapdotio @SuperteamEarn 2/ How x402 Works: The 4-Step Lifecycle\n\n1. Agent calls Hermes API without auth\n2. Gateway responds with HTTP 402 (Payment Required: $0.001 USDC)\n3. Agent signs \u0026amp; settles micro-payment on Solana\n4. Gateway verifies \u0026amp; delivers best DEX quote (200 OK)\n\nPure pay-per-call. (3/7)"
