      "text":"before writing any copy for a brand, we scrape their top competitors' Meta Ad Library.\n\nbuilt an agent (Hermes) that:\n- tracks active ad run durations\n- categorizes static vs video hooks\n- surfaces outlier angles\n\nif an ad has run 90+ days, they aren't losing money on it. https://t.co/UuN3JZlzSZ"
