      },
      "text":"→ SECURITY\n\nAn agent with access to your files, terminal or wallet needs more than good intentions.\n\nPOLYROB uses access roles, capability restrictions, skill scanning and controls around untrusted input.\n\nOpenClaw has a practical sandboxing approach, while Hermes offers pairing"
    },
