        "like_count":0,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"→ OWNERSHIP\n\nSelf-hosting is important, but I think there's another question worth asking:\n\nCan you actually build something on top of the agent and make it available to other people?\n\nPOLYROB puts considerable emphasis on agent ownership, self-hosting and the ability to operate"
    },
